1
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,897
Destiny. Fate. Dreams.

2
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:21,140
These unstoppable ideals are
held deep in the heart of man.

3
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:24,937
As long as there are people
who seek freedom in this life,

4
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,667
these things shall not
vanish from the earth.

5
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,497
People tell me my head's in the clouds.

6
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:40,897
I don't care what they say
because I'm dreaming of you.

7
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:43,557
You are the treasure I found.

8
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:46,657
So bright, so bold, and so elusive.

9
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,737
It's hard to look away.

10
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:51,877
Even though it's blinding me.

11
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:55,677
There are no words to
describe how I feel inside.

12
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:58,020
I'm really, really stuck on you.

13
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:02,537
I have to follow my dreams,
however crazy they seem.

14
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,577
And I won't stop till I
get there, you will see.

15
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:08,877
You're all I need to have
the strength to believe.

16
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:12,220
We live in wonderland.

17
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:21,117
I'm gonna follow my dreams,
however crazy they seem.

18
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:24,157
I'm gonna share them
with you, a love so true.

19
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:27,557
You're all I want,
together we can move on.

20
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,897
We'll live how we want to.

21
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:32,037
There is no limit to us.

22
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,537
We have the power of love.

23
00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:36,637
We don't want to live ordinary lives.

24
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:39,617
We have a chance to live in paradise.

25
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:42,480
We live in one another.

26
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,230
Luffy!

27
00:01:57,100 --> 00:01:59,220
Luffy! Luffy! Luffy! Luffy! Luffy!

28
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,150
Luffy!

29
00:02:00,233 --> 00:02:01,063
Luffy!

30
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,130
Luffy!

31
00:02:08,213 --> 00:02:09,580
I have terrible news!

32
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:10,937
A dinosaur ate Nami!

33
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:12,100
What in a way?

34
00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:14,657
We were running through the jungle
to get away from the dinosaur,

35
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:19,211
and then suddenly I turned around and
she was gone and must have gotten her.

36
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,140
I got my friend killed.

37
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:23,124
How can I live with myself now?

38
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,740
Hey, you guys, calm down.

39
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:29,592
Just listen to me for a second, will you?

40
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:32,906
If she was there one
moment and gone the next,

41
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:36,340
then you can't know for sure
what happened. Well, no.

42
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,757
It's not like it could stop and check.

43
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,817
I would have been eaten, too.

44
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:41,217
It was either a dinosaur
or some other wild beast.

45
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:43,117
What else could it possibly be?

46
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,494
I don't know for sure.

47
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:47,840
But if Baroque Works followed
us from Whiskey Peak,

48
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:50,517
it would make sense for them
to capture Nami and not you.

49
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:53,500
I think we may be in great
danger. We should go.

50
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:58,092
You mean that Baroque Works
is here on the island with us?

51
00:02:59,020 --> 00:02:59,850
Wait.

52
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:03,380
But why capture Nami and not me?

53
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,757
Because you haven't gotten in their way.

54
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:08,237
Most likely you aren't on
their assassination list.

55
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:09,320
Oh, okay.

56
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,257
Now that I think about it,

57
00:03:11,340 --> 00:03:14,928
I bet that booby-trapped alcohol
was meant to get us instead.

58
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:15,990
Huh? Huh?

59
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:18,124
What did you say about alcohol?

60
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:22,017
Broggy gave Dory some of your alcohol
that must have been tampered with,

61
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:25,100
