the barrels, they exploded.

62
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:27,940
No way!

63
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,355
They actually exploded inside the guy?

64
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,917
Wait, he was injured that badly
and he still ran off to go fight?

65
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,294
I tried to stop him and that's
how I ended up like this.

66
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:40,900
This is horrible!

67
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:44,677
Those two have been fighting as hard
as they can for a hundred years,

68
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,780
and they always ended in a draw.

69
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:56,377
Plus, their duels are fought with the
most honor and pride in the whole world!

70
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:57,290
Yeah.

71
00:03:57,373 --> 00:04:00,728
There's no way they can settle
it once and for all like this!

72
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,750
Ah! Ah!

73
00:04:10,833 --> 00:04:11,663
Get him!

74
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,680
Well, he keeps fighting.

75
00:04:19,580 --> 00:04:20,410
Hmm.

76
00:04:20,493 --> 00:04:22,880
He certainly is stubborn,
that Dory the Blue Ogre.

77
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,732
Yes, well, I should lend some assistance.

78
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,660
A whole century.

79
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:48,620
This has been a long and
difficult battle indeed.

80
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:31,100
I now know that this was a judgment.

81
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:34,560
A judgment from Elbath, the god of war.

82
00:05:34,780 --> 00:05:36,840
I didn't have the god's protection.

83
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:38,140
And that is all.

84
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,780
Stop it, Luffy! Calm down.

85
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:49,540
Who was it?

86
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:53,440
Who did that?

87
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:06,580
Hey, Mr. Three.

88
00:06:06,780 --> 00:06:08,309
I think I heard something.

89
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:14,620
Some pathetic animal yelping
helplessly in the jungle. Amusing.

90
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:24,300
Oh, these fights,

91
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:30,040
73, 467 duels,

92
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:36,357
73, 466 draws,

93
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:42,097
and one win

94
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:49,180
do

95
00:06:59,220 --> 00:07:00,050
I

96
00:07:00,133 --> 00:07:00,963
see tears of joy?

97
00:07:01,046 --> 00:07:02,517
I doubt that happiness will last long!

98
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:07,160
But for now I offer
you my congratulations.

99
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:08,794
Did you say happiness?

100
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,780
You know nothing!

101
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:14,360
Who are you little man? I am Mr. Three.

102
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:18,117
That's a code name of course which
is necessary in my line of work.

103
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:20,837
I am an artist of sorts
and this is my assistant.

104
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:23,397
All the best artists
require assistance you see.

105
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,310
Her name

106
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:25,857
is Miss Goldenweed.

107
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:30,293
I tell you all this because I've already
caught you in one of my artworks.

108
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:32,010
What?

109
00:07:32,093 --> 00:07:33,720
What have you done to me?

110
00:07:40,820 --> 00:07:41,860
Right, Luffy.

111
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:46,257
I don't know what we're dealing with here,
but I'm gonna take care of them myself.

112
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:48,040
I'll come too, Usopp. Good.

113
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:50,557
Having you along with
me will be reassuring.

114
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,169
You're not going anywhere.

115
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:56,540
You guys again!

116
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:05,474
You can have him back.

117
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:07,200
We don't need him.

118
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,590
